{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04911","headline":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤辇乘春陌，龙山访故台。\n北宫才尽处，南斗独昭回。\n肆览飞宸札，称觞引御杯。\n已观蓬海变，谁厌柏梁灾。\n代挹孙通礼，朝称贾谊才。\n忝侪文雅地，先後各时来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}